 🎤 Do my job for me: Axios BFD is just 11 days away, which means that interview prep is in full swing.

 My guests will include Robert Smith (CEO of Vista Equity Partners), Kim Posnett (global co-head of investment banking at Goldman Sachs), Chris Sacca (founder of Lowercarbon Capital), Alex Rodriguez (NBA/WNBA co-owner, CEO of A-Rod Corp.), and 1789 Capital's Omeed Malik and Donald Trump Jr. What should I ask them? dan@axios.com 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
